[Title: hololive 7th fes. Ridin' on Dreams]

34
00:33:12,758 --> 00:33:19,158
Harmony 重ねた言葉 届け
Harmony, delivering the words we overlapped...

35
00:33:47,928 --> 00:33:52,428
たどたどしく描いては ぎこちないと笑ってた
Drawing it clumsily, we laughed at how awkward it was...

36
00:33:52,628 --> 00:33:58,028
未来予想 あの日の続きを見よう
Let's see the future prediction, the continuation of that day.

37
00:33:58,428 --> 00:34:03,428
手と手 繋いで 風も着こなして 扉を叩いて 連れてくよ
Holding hands, mastering the wind, knocking on the door and taking you there—

38
00:34:03,428 --> 00:34:08,728
どんなことも 一緒なら超えていける
No matter what happens, if we're together, we can overcome it.

39
00:34:10,228 --> 00:34:13,628
ラララララ なりやまない希望をのべる ほら
Lalalalala, expressing hope that never stops, look!

40
00:34:14,128 --> 00:34:18,228
ラララララ 聞こえてる？ 響いてる？ 歌声
Lalalalala, can you hear it? Is it echoing? Our singing voice!

41
00:34:23,428 --> 00:34:30,128
Harmony 重ねた言葉 鮮やかな日々の向こう
Harmony, overlapping words beyond those vivid days—

42
00:34:30,128 --> 00:34:34,428
いつも君と響き合うのさ
We always resonate together with you.

43
00:34:34,428 --> 00:34:38,628
ふたりあとに結んだ夢が 空へ駆けていく
The dreams we tied together after two are running up into the sky—

44
00:34:38,628 --> 00:34:44,428
きらめき乗せて あなたへ届け メロディ どこまでも
Riding the sparkle, delivering the melody to you, no matter how far—

45
00:34:59,828 --> 00:35:04,628
何げないことを思い出す ひとり
Remembering the little things all by myself...

46
00:35:03,449 --> 00:35:09,949
一人じゃないよって深呼吸 未体験楽しむ 魔法の言葉
Taking a deep breath, knowing I’m not alone—the magic words to embrace the unknown.

47
00:35:10,949 --> 00:35:15,949
一息ついて ふと振り返って また君を知って
Pausing for a moment, looking back, and learning more about you...

48
00:35:15,949 --> 00:35:21,449
そのたびに ちょっと勇気出して 明日へ飛び込んでいける
And with just a bit of courage, diving into tomorrow.

49
00:35:23,949 --> 00:35:27,449
降り積もる 道しるべは まだ
The path ahead is still being laid...

50
00:35:29,949 --> 00:35:35,949
憶えてる歌
Yet I remember this song...

51
00:35:36,949 --> 00:35:46,449
Harmony, 手を伸ばしたら 足跡に 虹がかかる きっと晴れる 口ずさむステージ
When I reach out my hand, a rainbow forms over our footprints—the sky will surely clear, humming on this stage.

52
00:35:47,449 --> 00:35:54,949
ハートに記した場所へ 運ぶ約束を 輝きに乗せて
Guided by the marks on my heart, a promise carries me forward, riding on its radiance.

53
00:35:57,449 --> 00:36:02,449
世界へ 響け メロディー いつまでも
Let it echo through the world—this melody, forever!

54
00:36:03,949 --> 00:36:11,949
君と踏み出したあの一歩 あの瞬間が 宝物だって 胸を張る今
That first step we took together, that very moment is now a treasure I hold with pride.

55
00:36:14,949 --> 00:36:22,949
歩いて 話して はしゃいで 笑顔でゆくんだ 色褪せないまま
Walking, talking, playing, smiling, moving forward without fading away.

56
00:36:24,449 --> 00:36:30,449
混ざり合う 僕らの声 ほら 聞こえてる歌
Our voices blend together—look, can you hear this song?

57
00:36:37,949 --> 00:36:47,449
Harmony 重ねた言葉 鮮やかな日々の向こう ずっと君と 彩るよストーリー
Layered words, beyond the vivid days ahead—always with you, we’ll color this story.

58
00:36:48,449 --> 00:36:59,449
ハートに結んだ夢が 空へ駆けてゆく キラメキに乗せて あなたへ 届け 世界へ 響け
The dreams tied to our hearts race toward the sky, carried on shimmering light—let them reach you, let them echo through the world.

59
00:37:02,449 --> 00:37:08,949
愛を 込めて メロディー どこまでも
With love—this melody, endlessly!

60
00:37:37,449 --> 00:37:42,949
Parade, Parade, Parade! 輝くんだよ
Parade, parade, parade! Let it shine bright.

61
00:37:43,449 --> 00:37:48,449
呼び合う声を合図に
Using our calling-out voices as the signal.

62
00:37:50,449 --> 00:38:01,449
Parade, Parade, Parade! 探しにゆく スタートは何度だって
Parade, parade, parade! We'll go search for it—the start is a thousand times over.

63
00:38:13,949 --> 00:38:23,449
ただ 独り言を綴った ただ 始まりたくて 走った
Just muttering to myself, I ran because I wanted to begin.

64
00:38:33,449 --> 00:38:42,949
遠く 暗がりに灯った それは 眩し過ぎた名前 それは 優し過ぎる思い出
Lit up far in the darkness—it was a name that shone too brightly, it was a memory that was too gentle.

65
00:38:48,949 --> 00:38:54,949
もっと 近づけと 手を伸ばした 思いがけず 結び合った ほら 今
Wishing to get closer, I reached out my hand—unexpectedly we bonded, look, right now.

66
00:38:55,949 --> 00:39:02,949
迷い子は ふたりになった Parade, Parade, Parade! 輝くんだよ
The lost children became the two of us—Parade, parade, parade! Let it shine bright.

67
00:39:03,949 --> 00:39:08,949
悔しさも 愛しさも 連れておいで
Frustrations and endearments alike, bring them all along.

68
00:39:09,449 --> 00:39:13,449
風、夢、羽 飛び立てるさ
Winds, dreams, and wings—we can take flight.

69
00:39:14,449 --> 00:39:19,949
ささやかな祈りは 光 終わりなき 兆し
A modest prayer is light, an endless sign.

70
00:39:20,449 --> 00:39:27,449
君を 見つけたこと 胸を張れるよ ここから これから
Finding you is something I can be proud of, from here on out.

71
00:39:27,949 --> 00:39:39,449
Our Bright Parade, Parade! 輝くんだよ 呼び合う声を合図に Parade, Parade, Parade! 探しにゆく スタートは何度だって
Our bright parade, parade! Let it shine bright, using our calling-out voices as a signal. Our bright parade, parade! We'll go search for it—the start is a thousand times over.

72
00:39:40,449 --> 00:39:48,949
まだ 頼りない予感を 歌おう 恥ずかしくなんてないよ
Let's sing of this still-unreliable premonition—there's no need to feel embarrassed.

73
00:39:49,449 --> 00:39:58,949
誰も解けない イマジナリー いつかまた逢える おまじない
An imaginary spell that no one can untangle, a charm that we'll meet again someday.

74
00:39:59,449 --> 00:40:04,449
あの日 ゼロに 始まったストーリー
A story that began at zero on that day.

75
00:40:05,983 --> 00:40:10,843
数えきれない言の葉 数えるような想いじゃないさ
Words beyond counting aren't feelings to be tallied up like memories...

76
00:40:11,343 --> 00:40:15,723
ほら 今「僕等」を一つと呼ぼう
Look, let's call "us" one right now!

77
00:40:16,443 --> 00:40:20,503
Parade, parade, parade! 美しいんだよ
Parade, parade, parade, it's so beautiful!

78
00:40:21,103 --> 00:40:25,023
許し合える刹那 夜はきらめく
Moments when we can forgive each other, nights sparkle...

79
00:40:25,563 --> 00:40:30,063
雨 晴れ カレイド またとない空
Rain or shine, a kaleidoscope, a once-in-a-lifetime sky...

80
00:40:30,643 --> 00:40:36,003
相応しい旅路とは 君と在ることさ
A fitting journey is being right there with you!

81
00:40:36,503 --> 00:40:47,443
君と在ることなんだ
It's about existing together with you...

82
00:40:48,103 --> 00:40:51,903
「おかえり」って叫ぶよ
Shouting "Welcome back!"

83
00:40:52,683 --> 00:40:57,263
当たり前じゃないか
Isn't it a given?

84
00:40:08,643 --> 00:41:02,743
Parade, parade, parade! 輝くんだよ
Parade, parade, parade, it shines brightly!

85
00:41:03,303 --> 00:41:08,683
暗がりを満たすのは 君だ 僕だ！
What fills the darkness is you and me!

86
00:41:09,803 --> 00:41:14,683
Parade, parade, parade! 輝くんだよ
Parade, parade, parade, it shines brightly!

87
00:41:15,103 --> 00:41:19,223
悔しさも 愛しさも 連れておいで
Bring along both your frustrations and your affection...

88
00:41:19,543 --> 00:41:24,483
風 夢 羽 飛び立てるさ
Wind, dreams, wings, we can take flight!

89
00:41:24,823 --> 00:41:30,343
ささやかな祈りは光 終わりなき兆し
A modest prayer is light, an endless sign...

90
00:41:30,703 --> 00:41:35,263
君と飛び込んでゆく 素敵なスタートさ
Diving in together with you, what a wonderful start!

91
00:41:35,863 --> 00:41:40,963
ここから これから Our bright parade, parade!
From here, from now on, our bright parade, parade!

92
00:41:42,903 --> 00:41:46,063
Our Bright Parade!

93
00:42:06,443 --> 00:42:09,423
せーの！ ステージ3行くよ！
Ready, set! Stage 3, let's go!

94
00:42:46,943 --> 00:42:53,063
あの太陽より もっと高く 手を伸ばして
Reaching our hands even higher than that sun...

95
00:43:04,323 --> 00:43:13,323
長く 伸ばした 季節色の 影の上を 騒がしい 足跡で飾って
Decorating the shadow of seasonal colors we stretched out long with noisy footprints...

96
00:43:14,123 --> 00:43:18,903
ワクワクする方へ 向かおうか 決められた未来と
Heading toward what excites us, away from the predetermined future...

97
00:43:19,643 --> 00:43:24,063
逆の風景ばっか 行こうとしている
Trying to head toward the opposite scenery instead.

98
00:43:24,863 --> 00:43:29,343
間違ってないか？ がっかりしないか？
Are we making a mistake? Will we be disappointed?

99
00:43:29,643 --> 00:43:35,103
散々 迷って また今日に 立っていた
Wandering through it all, and standing here again today.

100
00:43:35,643 --> 00:43:45,063
誰も 歩かない 道の先で 霞んだ声がする
Further down a path no one walks, a faint voice echoes...

101
00:43:45,643 --> 00:43:54,823
誰も 気づけない 予想外の 明日が 今 閃いちゃったんだ！
An unexpected tomorrow that no one could foresee has suddenly flashed into my mind right now!

102
00:43:55,203 --> 00:44:01,363
どうしよう！ まだまだ頭が冴えていく
What should I do? My mind is getting sharper and sharper...

103
00:44:01,803 --> 00:44:09,703
今から世界に 恋しに行こう
Starting right now, let's go fall in love with the world!

104
00:44:10,163 --> 00:44:19,903
真っ直ぐ 昇ったまんま 消えない太陽に 手を伸ばして
Reaching out our hands toward the un-fading sun climbing straight up into the sky.

105
00:44:24,483 --> 00:44:33,323
覚えてるんだ 最初は 隠していた癖も 恥ずかしくて 語れない夢も
I remember them—the habits I hid at first, the dreams too embarrassing to talk about.

106
00:44:38,803 --> 00:44:49,903
一つ 一つは 特別に 見えなくても 重なり合って ほら 今 色めいた
Even if each one doesn't seem special on its own, they overlap and color the moment right now.

107
00:44:51,483 --> 00:45:02,743
お祭りでーす！ お祭りに居場所があって本当にありがとう！ この後も祭りの最高の歌で、これからも祭りは祭らしく突き進んでいこう！
It's a festival! Thank you so much for having a place here at the festival! With more festival songs to come, let's keep charging forward proudly as Matsuri!

108
00:45:03,531 --> 00:45:07,631
祭りもキミの居場所でいたいから 大好きだよ
Since I want this festival to be your place, I love you so much!

109
00:45:10,331 --> 00:45:19,691
待ちくたびれてないよ がっかりしないよ 散々な道が 一番楽しいんだ
I haven't been waiting long, I'm not disappointed, this long and winding road is the most fun of all!

110
00:45:20,591 --> 00:45:24,551
なんだろう ちょっとだけ頭がずれていく
Somehow, my head is slipping just a little bit out of sync...

111
00:45:25,271 --> 00:45:30,171
みんなと違ってるってへこんだ毎日が きっと最高になるから
Days when you feel down for being different from everyone else will surely become the best days!

112
00:45:31,131 --> 00:45:39,811
今から世界を抱きしに行こう しっかり登ったまま消えない太陽を
Let's go embrace the world right now, chasing the unyielding sun that climbed up high!

113
00:45:40,591 --> 00:45:43,111
追い抜かしてそうしよう
Let's pass it by and do just that!

114
00:45:44,251 --> 00:45:50,091
まだまだもっとを壊していく みんな変わってて笑った毎日が
Breaking through for more and more, everyday smiling while everyone changes...

115
00:45:50,591 --> 00:45:58,931
突然ドラマチックになるから 今すぐ世界に恋に落ちに行こう 遥か空の青さに負けないくらいに
Suddenly turning dramatic, let's go fall in love with the world right now, as brilliantly as the blue of the distant sky!

116
